stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft : 创建
  draft --> previewed : 预览完成
  previewed --> queued : 提交执行
  queued --> running : 消费者取到任务
  queued --> cancelled : 取消（仅 queued）
  running --> succeeded : 全部成功
  running --> partial_failed : 有跳过 / 失败项
  running --> failed : 整体失败
  partial_failed --> running : 重试失败项（复用 task_no）
  failed --> running : 重试
  failed --> dead : 超过最大重试
  dead --> running : 运维重放
  succeeded --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
